// Spot checks against the published format definitions: E4M3 has
// no infinity, its largest finite value is 448 at 0x7E, the smallest
// positive value is 2^-9 at 0x01, and only 0x7F/0xFF are NaN. E5M2
// has infinities at 0x7C/0xFC and its largest finite value is 57344.
// python3: e4m3[0x7e]=448.0, e5m2[0x7b]=57344.0
